    "turn_text": "Well, I think most of us, especially those of us in the West, keep the travel bag in the car. And in my case, I did an about-face. I was driving in North and did an about-face, straight for the boys here at Porton. And we got in the middle of things. You know, Kevin McCarthy, of course, Jarrett, Graves, Patrick, they were the mouthpiece on this negotiation. To their credit, there was a lot of interaction in between. There was a lot of dialogue. And you've heard the analogy of the sausage being made. We ground some sausage. over the last few days and it's still grinding, it's just over on the Senate side now.",
